OL,3,CSammy Wilson investigated by standards
OL,4,Ccommissioner
OL,6,FDUP MP Sammy Wilson is being
OL,7,Finvestigated by Westminster's
OL,8,Fstandards commissioner.
OL,10,FAccording to the parliamentary
OL,11,Fstandards commissioner's website, he
OL,12,Fis accused of a "failure to declare an
OL,13,Finterest".
OL,15,FNo further details have been revealed
OL,16,Fabout the investigation which was
OL,17,Fopened on July 28.
OL,19,FThe DUP has been approached for
OL,20,Fcomment.
OL,26,@tD@QOUuD@IO]
