OL,3,CSammy Wilson investigated by standards
OL,4,Ccommissioner
OL,6,FMr Wilson has been the DUP MP for East
OL,7,FAntrim since 2005.
OL,9,FIn 2024 he apologised to the Commons
OL,10,Ffor failing to declare a paid-for
OL,11,Foverseas trip when tabling a
OL,12,Fparliamentary question.
